flowchart TD
    A["项目陷阱（Gotcha）：反复出现的小坑"] --> B{"只在特定场景才相关？（Situational?）"}
    B -- "全局恒真" --> C["常备指令文件（Standing instructions）"]
    B -- "仅在特定情境" --> D["把指引嵌进工具输出（Embed in tool output）"]
    C -. "文件膨胀，单行失效（Prompt bloat）" .-> B
    D --> E["脚本检测触发情境（Script detects the situation）"]
    E --> F["指引恰逢其时浮现（Guidance at the right moment）"]
    F --> G["人与代理共用同一产物（Same artifact serves both）"]
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class D,E core;
    class B gate;
    class A,C,F,G out;
